    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "1EEACFED15ABF95A",
      "text": "Willkommen in der Arena von Moldrid!\\c\\nMöchtest du die Erklärung zur Arenaprüfung\\nnoch einmal hören?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "1EEACEED15ABF7A7",
      "text": "Deine Aufgabe wird es sein, am [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Olivenrollen[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\nteilzunehmen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "1EEACDED15ABF5F4",
      "text": "Um die Arenaprüfung zu bestehen, musst du\\neinen Ball, der einer Olive nachempfunden ist,\\r\\nins Ziel rollen.\\c\\nWenn dir das gelingt, werden wir nächstes Jahr\\nsicher mit einer reichen Olivenernte belohnt!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "1EEACCED15ABF441",
      "text": "Der Austragungsort für das Olivenrollen ist\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]nördlich der Stadt[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].\\c\\nWende dich für Details bitte an das Personal\\nvor Ort.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "5BE83F2D0544DB8E",
      "text": "Willkommen am Austragungsort für das\\nOlivenrollen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "5BE83E2D0544D9DB",
      "text": "Bei dieser Arenaprüfung musst du einen riesigen\\nOlivenball bewegen, indem du ihn kräftig anstößt.\\c\\nHier geht es also um Muskelkraft und Ausdauer!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "5BE83D2D0544D828",
      "text": "Bewältige die verschiedenen Hindernisse und\\nbefördere den Olivenball ins Ziel!\\c\\nGelingt dir das, hast du bestanden!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "5BE8442D0544E40D",
      "text": "Möchtest du dich an der Arenaprüfung\\nversuchen?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "5BE8432D0544E25A",
      "text": "Großartig! Dann sprich den Wunsch nach einer\\nreichen Ernte aus und bring den Ball mit aller\\r\\nKraft ins Rollen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "5BE8422D0544E0A7",
      "text": "Alles klar. Sprich mich einfach an, wenn du\\nbereit bist.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "5BE8412D0544DEF4",
      "text": "Willkommen zurück! Möchtest du dich jetzt am\\nOlivenrollen versuchen?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "5BE8382D0544CFA9",
      "text": "Wenn du mich besiegst, gebe ich vielleicht eine\\nAbkürzung für dich frei.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_09",
      "hash64": "5BE8372D0544CDF6",
      "text": "Dann wollen wir doch mal sehen, ob es dir\\ngelingt, meine Wand aus Olini zu überwinden!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_10",
      "hash64": "5BE4BA2D0541C3B8",
      "text": "Na gut, meine lieben Olini, gebt den Weg frei.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_11",
      "hash64": "5BE4BB2D0541C56B",
      "text": "Wenn du auf einem Pokémon reitest, kannst du\\ndie Olive viel einfacher ins Rollen bringen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_12",
      "hash64": "5BE4BC2D0541C71E",
      "text": "Dank dir dürfen wir uns wohl auch im nächsten\\nJahr auf eine reiche Ernte freuen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_13",
      "hash64": "5BE4BD2D0541C8D1",
      "text": "Du hast die Arenaprüfung bestanden!\\nHerzlichen Glückwunsch!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_14",
      "hash64": "5BE4BE2D0541CA84",
      "text": "Bitte sag am Empfang der Arena Bescheid,\\nwie deine Prüfung ausgegangen ist.\\c\\nUnd viel Erfolg beim Kampf gegen die\\nArenaleiterin!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_15",
      "hash64": "5BE4BF2D0541CC37",
      "text": "Möchtest du das Olivenrollen abbrechen?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_16",
      "hash64": "5BE4C02D0541CDEA",
      "text": "Bist du sicher, dass du aufgeben möchtest?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
